    "description": "Set on a white-sand beach along the shores of Delaport Bay, this upscale all-inclusive, couples-only resort is 7 km from Ardastra Gardens.\nThe elegant rooms offer flat-screen TVs and iPod docks, plus minifridges, and tea and coffeemaking facilities. Some have balconies, terraces and/or bay views. Upgraded rooms have free Wi-Fi and minibars, while some add living areas and/or direct pool access. Suites have separate living rooms and private butlers. Room service is available in some quarters.\nThere are 10 restaurants and 8 bars (including 2 swim-up bars). Other amenities include 7 outdoor pools, a spa and a gym. There's also a private island."
